{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Find object, move or take it, check properties. Scan area, if needed.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsPathClear    />",
